830/extras/8d6e41ffd56dded1d51dc77e5efe77a0.mp4?t=1745258071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master Your Craft</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1728830/extras/72ced89e4fbd03a594b9421b3b0acb5c.poster.avif?t=1745258071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1728830/extras/72ced89e4fbd03a594b9421b3b0acb5c.webm?t=1745258071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1728830/extras/72ced89e4fbd03a594b9421b3b0acb5c.mp4?t=1745258071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Career Mode: authored missions with unique twists to train and test your docking abilities<br></li><li> Random Jobs Content: Weekly missions, as well as 'on-demand' procedural work orders<br></li><li> Race Mode: push your flying skills to the max<br></li><li> Customizable virtual cockpit controls<br></li><li> Compete via Friends/Global leaderboards<br></li><li> Unlock flair and upgrades for your cockpit</li></ul>",
